        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Tristan worked with me for a couple of months on neck pain which led to me experiencing persistent pins and needles in my limbs. He was great! patient, kind, and dedicated. He did not stop until he figured out what was causing my issues and found a solution. I feel lucky to have had Tristan work with me.",
