        "text": "I had a physio evaluation redone by Kelly.  She was very professional and gave me some knowledgeable tips. She is  a highly experienced physiotherapist. Kelly is the perfect physiotherapist for people who are athletic and active. I appreciate She took the time to listen to my concerns and I will diffently go back to visit Cappino for many services. Thank you",
